    {
      "section_id": "section_0",
      "type": "intro",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "I be on the hotline, like e'ryday",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Makin' sure the DJ know what I want him to play",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "You know I got my top back and my beat low",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Rockin' my stunna shades and turnin' up my radio",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Turn up my radio (Radio, radio)",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "I think I'm in love with my radio",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "'Cause it never lets me down",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "And I fall in love with my stereo",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Whenever I hear that sound",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
