    {
      "section_id": "section_3",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "You're the only one that papa allowed to hang out in my room",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "With the door closed, we'd be alone",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "And mama never freaked out when she heard it go \"boom\"",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "'Cause she knew we were in the zone",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_4",
      "type": "pre-chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Hold him in my arms and look out of my window",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "(Under the moonlight)",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "And he'd be keepin' me calm so I'd never let him go",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "He's got a place in my heart",
          "persona_id": "persona_sasha_fierce"
        }
      ]
    },
